{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"卷八百五十二◎飲食部十","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"○〈麥咅〉〈麥主〉","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"束晳《餅賦》曰：〈麥咅〉〈麥主〉髓燭。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"○甘脆","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"范汪《祠製》曰：孟夏祭，下甘脆。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"○安幹特","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"束晳《餅賦》曰：安幹、粔籹之倫。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"盧諶《祭法》曰：四時祠皆用安幹特。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《禮記·內則》曰：棗、栗、飴、蜜以甘之。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《方言》曰：饧謂之張皇，(即幹飴也。)飴謂之饣亥，(音該。)饧謂之糖。(江東皆言糖也。)凡飴謂之饧，自關而東，陳魏宋楚衛之間通語。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《說文》曰：飴，米蘖煎也。饧，飴和饊也。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《釋名》曰：饧，洋也，煮米消烂洋洋然也。飴，小弱於饧，形怡怡然也。哺，餔也，如饧而濁可哺也。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《後漢書》曰：明德馬皇後報章帝曰：\"吾但當含飴弄孫，不能复關政矣。\"","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《東觀漢記》曰：野王獻甘膠膏饧，每作，大發吏，以為饒利。樊閎知之，臨薨奏焉。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《四王起事》曰：惠帝到華陰，河間王遣使上甘果餔二百幡。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《幽明錄》曰：王胤、祖安國、張顯等以太元中乘船，見仙人賜糖飴三餅，大如比輪錢，厚二分。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《淮南子》曰：柳下惠見飴曰：\"可以養老。\"盜跖見飴曰：\"可以粘牡。\"見物同而用之異也。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《鹽鐵論》曰：洗爵以盛水，升降而進糖，禮雖備，然非其貴也。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《世說》曰：王君夫飴餔澳釜。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《楚辭·招魂》曰：粔籹蜜餌有張皇。(張皇，饧也。)","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"張衡《七辨》曰：沙飴石蜜，遠國貢储。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"崔寔《四民月令》曰：十月，先水冻作煮饧，煮暴飴。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"盧諶《祭法》曰：冬祠用荆饧。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_852_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_852","text":"《太平御覽》　宋·李昉","sortOrder":25}],"overrides":{}}